# API Base URL
#
# Development (Vercel + local Vite proxy):
#   Leave unset or use "/api". Vite (vite.config.js) proxies /api to the
#   local backend at http://localhost:5000, and Vercel rewrites /api/* to
#   the serverless backend on the same domain. No external host needed.
#
# Production with the backend on the SAME Vercel domain (recommended):
#   VITE_API_URL=/api
#
# Production with the backend hosted ELSEWHERE (e.g. an office server):
#   Set VITE_API_URL to the PUBLIC backend URL, e.g. https://api.example.com/api
#   Do NOT put a private LAN IP here - browsers cannot reach it from Vercel.
VITE_API_URL=/api